---
layout: page.liquid
lang: en
permalink: /en/blog/
title: Blog
lead: Notes on .NET, architecture and the things I build off the clock, including the parts that went sideways.
description: Henrik Becker on .NET, software architecture, AI tools and side projects.
---
{%- comment -%} The blog index. English only, so no translationKey; the Swedish menu links here too. {%- endcomment -%}
<ul class="post-list">
  {%- for post in collections.blog %}
  {%- assign post_date = post.date | date: "%Y-%m-%d" %}
  <li>
    <time datetime="{{ post_date }}">{{ post_date }}</time>
    <div>
      <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
      {% if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
<p class="post-list__feed"><a href="/en/blog/feed.xml">Atom feed</a></p>
